{"id":"wb-1-176","name":"岳飞墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"杭州岳王庙","text":"杭州岳王庙是纪念及祭祀南宋时期名将岳飞的庙宇，为所有岳王庙中最有名的一座。岳王庙位于杭州西湖西北角、栖霞岭南麓，始建于南宋嘉定十四年（1221年），因岳飞葬于此地，故杭州岳王庙又称岳坟。1961年，杭州岳王庙被中华人民共和国国务院列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%AD%E5%B7%9E%E5%B2%B3%E7%8E%8B%E5%BA%99","revisionId":92773532,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92773532","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核百科重定向、文物名称与同一地点；引用版本已锁定","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/93bae1a16ffdb7867a5afd78.jpg","title":"Yue_Fei_Temple,_2015-03-22_36.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yue_Fei_Temple,_2015-03-22_36.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e2/Yue_Fei_Temple%2C_2015-03-22_36.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​杭州岳王庙","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图","subject":"杭州岳王庙"}}